{"title":"King Douglas Fir Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eTraditional Holiday Charm in a Space-Saving Design\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"389\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eBring home the timeless charm of a classic Douglas Fir with the King Douglas Fir Slim artificial Christmas tree collection from King of Christmas. Designed with lifelike needles, rich greenery, and handcrafted detail, the King Douglas Fir Slim offers the beauty and fullness of a traditional Christmas tree in a more space-saving silhouette.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"389\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eIts slender profile makes it the perfect choice for apartments, entryways, smaller living rooms, corners, and narrow spaces where a full-width tree may feel oversized. Thoughtfully designed to maintain a lush and festive appearance, the King Douglas Fir Slim delivers elegant holiday style without compromising on realism or fullness.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"986\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhy choose the King Douglas Fir Slim?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1325\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe King Douglas Fir Slim is designed for those who want the look of a traditional Christmas tree while maximizing space throughout the home. Unlike many slim trees that can appear sparse or minimal, the King Douglas Fir Slim features lush greenery and realistic branch construction that create a balanced and natural-looking silhouette.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eIts rich evergreen tones and handcrafted branch detail help recreate the appearance of a freshly cut Douglas Fir while offering the convenience and durability of an artificial Christmas tree.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1591\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eIs the King Douglas Fir Slim a realistic artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1887\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eYes. The King Douglas Fir Slim is crafted with realistic and classic branch tips designed to replicate the texture, fullness, and color variation found in natural evergreen trees. Its molded tips and layered greenery create a lifelike appearance that feels warm, timeless, and inviting.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"2014\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe slim profile also allows the tree to maintain an elegant and refined look while fitting comfortably into narrower spaces.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2067\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eDoes the King Douglas Fir Slim still look full?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2326\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eYes. While the King Douglas Fir Slim features a narrower silhouette, it is carefully designed to maintain a lush and festive appearance. Its layered branch structure creates beautiful fullness and dimension throughout the tree without overwhelming the room.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2487\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe result is a slim artificial Christmas tree that feels elegant, realistic, and substantial while still offering a more compact footprint for smaller spaces.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3482\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eIs the King Douglas Fir Slim available pre-lit and unlit?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3484\" data-end=\"3624\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eYes. The King Douglas Fir Slim collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate a variety of decorating preferences.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3890\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur pre-lit models feature professionally installed warm white or multicolor LED lights designed to create a soft and inviting glow throughout the tree. Unlit options provide the flexibility to customize your holiday display with your preferred lighting and décor.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"3892\" data-end=\"3952\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eIs the King Douglas Fir Slim easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3954\" data-end=\"4223\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eYes. The King Douglas Fir Slim is designed for easy setup, shaping, and convenient after-season storage. Its hinged branch construction allows the branches to naturally fall into place during assembly, helping create a realistic and full appearance with minimal effort.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4406\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand, complimentary setup gloves for comfortable shaping and fluffing, and a complimentary storage bag for convenient off-season storage and protection.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4598\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhen the season is over, the tree can be easily disassembled and stored in a cool, dry place to help preserve its realistic foliage and overall appearance for years of continued holiday use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2729\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eExplore the King Douglas Fir collection to find a slim artificial Christmas tree designed to bring timeless holiday beauty, realistic detail, and effortless elegance into your home season after season.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-douglas-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"7.5' King Douglas Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 800 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the natural elegance of a real Douglas Fir, the King Douglas Fir features lifelike needles and a graceful, slender silhouette. Handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, Designed for realism and effortless upkeep, it fills your home with the spirit of the season and becomes a cherished centerpiece for holiday celebrations year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642930458688,"sku":"KDFS-T7.5-L","price":549.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingDouglasFirSlim_b6ee2028-b2be-4aa7-b263-477f086b3c1c.jpg?v=1783959840"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-douglas-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"9' King Douglas Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the natural elegance of a real Douglas Fir, the King Douglas Fir features lifelike needles and a graceful, slender silhouette. Handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, Designed for realism and effortless upkeep, it fills your home with the spirit of the season and becomes a cherished centerpiece for holiday celebrations year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642930589760,"sku":"KDFS-T9-U","price":449.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-9.jpg?v=1718158796"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-douglas-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"9' King Douglas Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 1000 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the natural elegance of a real Douglas Fir, the King Douglas Fir features lifelike needles and a graceful, slender silhouette. Handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, Designed for realism and effortless upkeep, it fills your home with the spirit of the season and becomes a cherished centerpiece for holiday celebrations year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642930655296,"sku":"KDFS-T9-L","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingDouglasFirSlim_b6ee2028-b2be-4aa7-b263-477f086b3c1c.jpg?v=1783959840"},{"product_id":"10-foot-king-douglas-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"10' King Douglas Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the natural elegance of a real Douglas Fir, the King Douglas Fir features lifelike needles and a graceful, slender silhouette. Handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, Designed for realism and effortless upkeep, it fills your home with the spirit of the season and becomes a cherished centerpiece for holiday celebrations year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":32879328395341,"sku":"KDFS-T10-U","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-9_bb37a48f-ec61-440d-8240-117b6d78d572.jpg?v=1718158060"},{"product_id":"10-foot-king-douglas-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"10' King Douglas Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 1200 Warm White \u0026 Mu